    <string name="mj_app_name" translatable="false">MJ PDF</string>
    <string name="what_is_new">
        * Added support for Arabic, Chinese, Turkish, German, Spanish, Portuguese, Hindi, Russian.\n\n
        * Search Enhancements: Back to results button; better highlighting.\n\n
        * UI Fixes: Consistent icon colors, improved layout and visibility.\n\n
        * Added Always Horizontal mode.\n\n
        * Added Experimental Reload PDF button in the settings.\n\n
        * Better support for password-protected and non-local PDFs.\n\n
        * Stability: Fixed crashes from background operations.\n\n
        * Development: Upgraded SDK, Gradle, and dependencies.
    </string>
